  dry, straight road, 80 km/h limit.

  Timeline (s):  0 both at 80 km/h | 3.5 V1 starts drifting left
                 7.9 V2 brakes + steers left | 8.0 V1 brakes + steers right
                 9.0 impact (~55 km/h each) | 10.5 at rest | 12.5 end
